FIORA uses a graph network model to predict the precursor stability σ and the fragment abundances θf from a molecular graph G. Since the fragment space \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
