				\begin{document}$${{\rm{Spectral}}}\,{{\rm{cosine}}}\,{{\rm{similarity}}}({S}_{A},{S}_{B},t)=\frac{{\sum }_{(m{z}_{k},{I}_{k})\in {S}_{A}}{\sum }_{(m{z}_{l},{I}_{l})\in {S}_{B}}{I}_{k}{I}_{l}{{\mathbb{1}}}_{| m{z}_{k}-{mz}_{l}| \le t}}{\sqrt{{\sum}_{(m{z}_{k},{I}_{k})\in {S}_{A}}{I}_{k}^{2}}\sqrt{{\sum}_{(m{z}_{l},{I}_{l})\in {S}_{B}}{I}_{l}^{2}}}.$$\end{document}Spectralcosinesimilarity(SA,SB,t)=∑(mzk,Ik)∈SA∑(mzl,Il)∈SBIkIl1∣mzk−mzl∣≤t∑(mzk,Ik)∈SAIk2∑(mzl,Il)∈SBIl2.
